  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '5fb23b1c-ff61-4e11-b879-2cb82e69505b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Discuss the role of individual inspiration and moral improvement, as suggested by Ashoka's words, in achieving a collective vision of peace.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-784Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '5fb23b1c-ff61-4e11-b879-2cb82e69505b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$How does the text use the imagery of the "sun sets" and "curtains slowly close" to convey the end of an era and the enduring nature of Ashoka's vision?$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-784Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '5fb23b1c-ff61-4e11-b879-2cb82e69505b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Analyze the ethical framework that underpins Ashoka's rule, drawing connections between his boasts, his vision, and the principles he advocates.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-784Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '5fb23b1c-ff61-4e11-b879-2cb82e69505b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Discuss the implications of promoting "compassion" as a central theme for learning, as suggested in the text, in the context of Ashoka's teachings.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-784Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '5fb23b1c-ff61-4e11-b879-2cb82e69505b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$How does Ashoka's legacy, as presented in the text, offer a model for leadership that prioritizes human welfare and moral values over material gains and military might?$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-784Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true);
INSERT INTO public.question_bank (id, institution_id, subject_id, topic_id, grade_level_id, class_group_id, question_text, question_type, options, correct_answer, marks, difficulty_level, tags, source, created_by, is_approved, parent_question_id, sub_question_count, sequence_order) VALUES
  ('94d82a0a-55f8-4fce-9484-dbc7101e701f', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '5fb23b1c-ff61-4e11-b879-2cb82e69505b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Emperor Ashoka, having transitioned from a conqueror to a proponent of peace, addresses his court, highlighting the prosperity and compassion now flourishing in his kingdom. He speaks of trading swords for tools of development and establishing institutions for health and education. However, his son, Mahinda, voices concerns about the empire's vulnerability to external threats, using the analogy of a shepherd laying down his staff. Ashoka counters by emphasizing the strength in turning enemies into friends and investing in peace and people for profound security.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-784Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('58e656a6-f4f1-421c-a4ff-7e7ae0ddfa0e', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '5fb23b1c-ff61-4e11-b879-2cb82e69505b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The transformation of Ashoka's empire is marked by a shift from military might to moral strength. The text describes roads connecting provinces, hospitals nurturing health, and schools teaching wisdom and peace. Ashoka asserts that this is the true power of an empire, built on kindness. Yet, Mahinda's apprehension suggests that not all within the empire are convinced of this new path, fearing that such a stance might invite aggression.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-784Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('35000394-3bc8-47de-ae96-ce69c63dacaa', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '5fb23b1c-ff61-4e11-b879-2cb82e69505b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Ashoka's declaration, 'We will invest in peace and people. With these, we will gain more profound security and stability than any fortress could provide,' encapsulates his revolutionary approach to statecraft. This statement directly challenges the traditional view, articulated by Mahinda, that an empire must maintain a strong military posture to deter threats. The dialogue sets up a fundamental debate on the nature of power and security.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-784Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('0a79cf23-399e-4975-b7f7-0890081079a9', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '5fb23b1c-ff61-4e11-b879-2cb82e69505b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$A newly appointed governor in a distant province, inspired by the pillars' messages, faces a local dispute over land. The traditional approach would be military intervention.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-784Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
  ('c53655dc-332e-4879-a315-dcbd8470f1e3', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '5fb23b1c-ff61-4e11-b879-2cb82e69505b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$A group of courtiers, accustomed to the old ways of conquest, privately express skepticism about Ashoka's "peacemaker" identity, viewing it as weakness.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-784Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
  ('ff3e1e9d-f9ba-4608-9ce2-e6b964ca8727', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '5fb23b1c-ff61-4e11-b879-2cb82e69505b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Mahinda observes a growing tension with a neighboring kingdom, which is building up its military. He recalls his father's words about peace.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-784Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
  ('e399fade-6f2a-48eb-b145-fc0d22fa02dd', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '5fb23b1c-ff61-4e11-b879-2cb82e69505b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Vitashoka, while admiring the pillars, wonders how their messages of "kindness and compassion" can translate into practical governance in a complex empire.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-784Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 1, NULL),
  ('79207925-d8fe-40ba-b595-41dcfd007e71', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '5fb23b1c-ff61-4e11-b879-2cb82e69505b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$A small community within the empire is struggling with internal animosity and fear, leading to disunity and hindering progress.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-784Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
  ('2bb1685b-1e21-49df-8770-b69214c881fe', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '5fb23b1c-ff61-4e11-b879-2cb82e69505b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Ashoka is considering the design of a new public building. Some advisors suggest grand, intimidating architecture to project power.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-784Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 1, NULL),
  ('192dd564-0019-480c-a0b3-ac8479e7db1d', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '5fb23b1c-ff61-4e11-b879-2cb82e69505b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$A young scholar is tasked with interpreting the "wisdom of a sage" embodied in the pillars for the common people.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-784Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 1, NULL),
  ('c87eae31-2a8d-42e9-8031-592d79212c71', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '5fb23b1c-ff61-4e11-b879-2cb82e69505b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The empire faces a severe drought, leading to widespread suffering and potential unrest. Traditional rulers might blame external forces or gods.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-784Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 1, NULL),
