  ('dc593107-3905-4afc-baeb-2878a737e986', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '5fb23b1c-ff61-4e11-b879-2cb82e69505b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Mahinda, reflecting on his father's transformation, struggles to reconcile the image of the "conqueror" with the "peacemaker."$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-784Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 1, NULL),
  ('1df77050-b94c-4b79-9c27-6b0601f6df25', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '5fb23b1c-ff61-4e11-b879-2cb82e69505b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The royal treasury is debating funding for a new military campaign versus investing in public welfare projects.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-784Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 1, NULL),
  ('89d9e7c7-f39b-4403-bfe9-178764dc2a5a', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '5fb23b1c-ff61-4e11-b879-2cb82e69505b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$A local elder expresses concern that the "lessons of these pillars" might be forgotten by future generations if not actively reinforced.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-784Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 1, NULL),
  ('2a5c7bd0-0a8a-4767-9a0d-4efda4c49080', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '5fb23b1c-ff61-4e11-b879-2cb82e69505b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Vitashoka observes a group of children playing near the pillars, mimicking the engraved figures.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-784Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 1, NULL),
  ('b4ba5c20-cc58-4a12-ac78-13e79abe7e5e', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '5fb23b1c-ff61-4e11-b879-2cb82e69505b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$A neighboring king, known for his cruelty and indifference, sends an envoy to Ashoka, seeking to understand his empire's unusual peace.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-784Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 1, NULL),
  ('8d0313fe-b110-487d-ad19-487e198ae9bb', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '5fb23b1c-ff61-4e11-b879-2cb82e69505b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Ashoka's courtiers are preparing for his final address. They suggest he highlight his military achievements to solidify his image.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-784Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 1, NULL),
